// bootstrap: normalization — 归一化: WL核+等价类+冗余检测

Point normalization:
  wl_kernel(expr: Expr) -> NormalForm
  equivalence_class(elements: set[Expr]) -> set[set[Expr]]
  redundancy_check(db: KnowledgeBase) -> set[Expr]

Constraint normalization:
  wl_kernel is idempotent: kernel(kernel(x)) = kernel(x)
  equivalence_class partitions the set
  redundancy_check removes derivable expressions

Prove;
Normalize;
